# The build context is attack surface, not a convenience: everything listed here would
# otherwise be uploaded to the daemon and could end up in a layer by one careless COPY.
# A .env file has no business in any image (T-02-23), and .git carries the full history
# including anything that was ever committed by mistake.
.git
.github
.gitignore
.planning
.venv
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
tests
docs
scripts
__pycache__
*.pyc
.env*
.harp-certs
compose*.yml
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
